<div id="title-screen" class="screen">
  <div class="edition">A FALLING-BLOCK JOURNEY</div>
  <div class="wordmark">Stillwater</div>
  <div class="tagline">Make space. Find your rhythm.</div>
  <div class="menu">
    <button id="menu0" class="selected" data-event-click="emit('Journey')"><span class="index">01</span>Journey<span class="aside">Six chapters, one horizon</span></button>
    <button id="menu1" data-event-click="emit('Endless')"><span class="index">02</span>Endless<span class="aside">Stay a little longer</span></button>
    <button id="menu2" data-event-click="emit('Sprint')"><span class="index">03</span>Forty lines<span class="aside">A quiet race with yourself</span></button>
    <button id="menu3" data-event-click="emit('Duet')"><span class="index">04</span>Duet<span class="aside">A shared journey for two</span></button>
    <button id="menu4" data-event-click="emit('Guide')"><span class="index">05</span>How to play<span class="aside">Take your first breath</span></button>
    <button id="menu5" data-event-click="emit('Settings')"><span class="index">06</span>Settings<span class="aside">Make yourself comfortable</span></button>
  </div>
  <div class="chapter-picker"><button data-event-click="emit('ChapterPrevious')">&#8249;</button><span id="chapter-choice">CHAPTER 1 / 1   First light</span><button data-event-click="emit('ChapterNext')">&#8250;</button></div>
  <div class="title-foot">ARROWS TO CHOOSE &nbsp; / &nbsp; ENTER TO BEGIN &nbsp; / &nbsp; CONTROLLER A TO CONFIRM</div>
  <div id="record" class="record">ENDLESS BEST   0</div>
  <div class="imprint">STILLWATER<br/>ORIGINAL MUSIC &amp; ART<br/>BUILT WITH CHIBI</div>
</div>
<div id="hud">
  <div class="hud-brand">Stillwater</div>
  <div class="chapter"><span id="chapter-number">01 / 06</span><span id="chapter-name">First light</span></div>
  <div id="clock">0:00</div>
  <div class="scoreboard score-a"><div class="small player-label">PLAYER ONE</div><div class="small">SCORE</div><div id="score1" class="score">0</div><div id="lines1" class="small">0 LINES</div></div>
  <div class="scoreboard score-b"><div class="small">PLAYER TWO</div><div class="small">SCORE</div><div id="score2" class="score">0</div><div id="lines2" class="small">0 LINES</div></div>
  <div class="board-label hold-a">HOLD</div><div class="board-label next-a">NEXT</div>
  <div class="board-label hold-b">HOLD</div><div class="board-label next-b">NEXT</div>
  <div id="partner-wait1" class="partner-wait wait-a">WAITING FOR A RESCUE<br/><span>Your partner can bring you back.</span></div>
  <div id="partner-wait2" class="partner-wait wait-b">WAITING FOR A RESCUE<br/><span>Your partner can bring you back.</span></div>
  <div id="chapter-arrival">First light</div>
  <div id="goal">12 LINES TO NEXT CHAPTER</div>
  <div id="seed">SEED 73129</div>
  <div class="play-controls solo-controls">&#8592; &#8594; MOVE &nbsp; &#8593; / X ROTATE &nbsp; Z REVERSE &nbsp; &#8595; SOFT DROP &nbsp; SPACE DROP &nbsp; C HOLD &nbsp; P PAUSE</div>
  <div class="play-controls duet-controls">P1 &nbsp; ARROWS · Z / X · SPACE · C &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; P2 &nbsp; A / D · Q / E · S · W DROP · R HOLD &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; P PAUSE</div>
  <div class="pad-controls">PAD &nbsp; D-PAD MOVE / DOWN SOFT / UP DROP &nbsp; A / B ROTATE &nbsp; SHOULDERS HOLD &nbsp; START PAUSE</div>
</div>
<div id="pause-screen" class="veil">
  <div class="dialog"><div class="eyebrow">PAUSED</div><div id="pause-title" class="dialog-title">Take your time</div><div id="pause-detail" class="detail">Your place is waiting.</div>
    <button id="pause0" class="selected" data-event-click="emit('Resume')">Continue<span class="aside">Enter</span></button>
    <button id="pause1" data-event-click="emit('Restart')">Start again<span class="aside">Same seed</span></button>
    <button id="pause2" data-event-click="emit('Settings')">Settings<span class="aside">Sound &amp; movement</span></button>
    <button id="pause3" data-event-click="emit('Home')">Return to shore<span class="aside">Main menu</span></button>
  </div>
</div>
<div id="result-screen" class="veil">
  <div class="dialog"><div class="eyebrow">JOURNEY LOG</div><div id="result-title" class="dialog-title">A moment to breathe</div><div id="result-detail" class="detail">Every piece is a fresh beginning.</div><div id="result-score" class="result-score">0 POINTS</div>
    <button id="result0" class="selected" data-event-click="emit('Restart')">Once more<span class="aside">Same seed</span></button>
    <button id="result1" data-event-click="emit('Home')">Return to shore<span class="aside">Main menu</span></button>
  </div>
</div>
<div id="settings-screen" class="veil">
  <div class="settings-panel"><div class="eyebrow">YOUR SPACE</div><div class="dialog-title">Make yourself comfortable</div><div class="detail">Select with up / down. Adjust with left / right. Click a row to increase or toggle.</div>
    <button id="setting0" data-event-click="emit('Setting0')">Master volume<span id="value0" class="setting-value">80%</span></button>
    <button id="setting1" data-event-click="emit('Setting1')">Music<span id="value1" class="setting-value">65%</span></button>
    <button id="setting2" data-event-click="emit('Setting2')">Sound effects<span id="value2" class="setting-value">75%</span></button>
    <button id="setting3" data-event-click="emit('Setting3')">Movement delay<span id="value3" class="setting-value">150 ms</span></button>
    <button id="setting4" data-event-click="emit('Setting4')">Movement repeat<span id="value4" class="setting-value">35 ms</span></button>
    <button id="setting5" data-event-click="emit('Setting5')">Visual effects<span id="value5" class="setting-value">Full</span></button>
    <button id="setting6" data-event-click="emit('Setting6')">Reduced motion<span id="value6" class="setting-value">Off</span></button>
    <button id="setting7" data-event-click="emit('Setting7')">Ghost piece<span id="value7" class="setting-value">On</span></button>
    <div class="settings-footer"><button data-event-click="emit('AdjustDown')">&#8722;</button><button data-event-click="emit('AdjustUp')">+</button><button class="done" data-event-click="emit('Home')">Save &amp; return</button></div>
  </div>
</div>
<div id="guide-screen" class="veil">
  <div class="guide-panel"><div class="eyebrow">A LITTLE ROOM TO LEARN</div><div class="dialog-title">One piece at a time</div>
    <div class="guide-columns">
      <div class="guide-column"><div class="guide-heading">Find the gaps</div><p>Complete horizontal rows to clear them. Seven different pieces arrive in shuffled bags. Every piece appears once in each bag.</p><p>The faint piece shows where a drop will land. Hold one piece for later. Hold becomes available again after you place a piece.</p><div class="guide-heading">Make space</div><p>Soft drop earns one point per cell. Hard drop earns two and locks immediately. You have half a second to adjust on the ground, up to fifteen resets.</p><p>Clear four rows at once or tuck a T with a final rotation for a scoring bonus. Consecutive clears build a combo. Keep difficult clears going for a back-to-back bonus.</p></div>
      <div class="guide-column"><div class="guide-heading">Your journey</div><p>Journey has six chapters, twelve lines each. Chapters unlock as you reach them. Choose an unlocked chapter on the title screen with left / right.</p><p>Endless grows faster as you clear. Forty lines always uses seed 40040 so personal bests have the same sequence.</p><div class="guide-heading">A duet for two</div><p>Two players share a journey of six twenty-line chapters. Every cleared line fills the rescue reserve, up to eight.</p><p>Four charges rescue a topped-out partner by lowering their stack six rows. Keep clearing while they wait. The journey ends when both boards top out without a rescue.</p><p>Use two controllers, a controller and keyboard, or one shared keyboard. Controller 1 and arrows control the left board. Controller 2 and A / D control the right.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="guide-keys">PLAYER 1 &nbsp; &#8592; &#8594; move · &#8593; / X clockwise · Z counterclockwise · &#8595; soft · SPACE drop · C / SHIFT hold<br/>PLAYER 2 &nbsp; A / D move · E clockwise · Q counterclockwise · S soft · W drop · R hold<br/>CONTROLLER &nbsp; D-pad / left stick move · A / B rotate · D-pad up drop · shoulder hold · START pause</div>
    <button class="guide-done" data-event-click="emit('Home')">Return to shore<span class="aside">Enter / Backspace</span></button>
  </div>
</div>
<div id="notice"></div>
